# 🚀 C# Learning Journey

Welcome to my C# Learning Journey!

This repository documents my progression from learning the fundamentals of C# to building production-ready applications with ASP.NET Core.

---

## 🎯 Purpose

The goal of this repository is to:

- Learn C# from the ground up.
- Build practical projects after every concept.
- Practice professional Git and GitHub workflows.
- Create a portfolio that demonstrates consistent growth.
- Prepare for backend software development and eventually build enterprise-scale applications such as **ArdhaHub**.

